  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 134dc740d30ba8e42a809cf45eef40b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: C2LVL1-2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - Look, who am I to go against the advice of the love guru herself?
  - <?BowleyStartShaking=15,15,1> Does your heart not beat in that cold rib cage
    of yours?
  - "You\u2019re still around aren\u2019t you?"
  - <?BowleyStartShaking=15,15,1> Well what WE have is special.
  - <?BowleyStartShaking=15,15,1> SOMETHING NO TRUE LOVE CAN EVER REPLACE
  - ...
  - "I\u2019m going to call Hermes."
